WEBVTT

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.320
<b>Master</b>

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.480
Master.

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:36.950
Someone to admire, to follow...

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:40.990
An important person to lead 
one down the right path.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:46.620
But there comes a time when every
student strives to surpass their master.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:50.250
<b>Report Card</b>

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.090
A practical skills test instead 
of a regular exam, huh?

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.390
The format of the test is up 
to each team's jonin, too.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.430
What're you gonna do, Kakashi?

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.640
I'll pass them if they can beat 
me in rock-paper-scissors.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.770
Ah, very nice!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.900
All right, I'll pit all four 
of us against each other,

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.860
in a no-holds barred battle royale
until only one remains!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.320
That's overdoing it!

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.410
Plus only one person could pass.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.540
Back in the day they were so hopeless,

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.370
but they've truly become strong.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.460
Speaking of which,

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.580
I hear Naruto's really 
something else these days.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:45.890
Yeah...

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:48.850
He's left me in the dust.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.020
So the student has surpassed the master.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.570
It's a little frustrating,

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.400
but he can't be my student forever.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:02.490
Don't go crazy with this, okay?

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.280
Right.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:13.290
<b>Student vs. Master!
Rock Lee vs. Might Guy!</b>

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.450
What do you think he called us for?

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:24.720
He's probably thought up another 
ridiculous training method.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.430
Sounds good!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.480
If I'm gonna be come a splendid 
ninja like Guy Sensei,

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.230
I have to go full tilt,
 no matter what he makes me do!

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.070
Yadda yadda yadda...

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.890
And so, for our team's test you will

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.240
He's too excited...

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.950
No complaints!

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.700
Come at me in any order you want!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.830
You're amazing, Guy Sensei, giving us
the chance to face you directly!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:54.920
Good lord...

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.710
Way too excited.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.680
Good!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.850
Eight Trigrams Air Palm!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.440
You pass!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.160
It's finally my turn.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.620
Here I come, Guy Sensei!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.030
Give it your all, Lee.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:29.830
Yes!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.410
Leaf Un, Deux, Trois!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.210
It'll take more than that!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.210
I should've expected that 
from you, Guy Sensei.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.130
But...

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.630
The Eight Gates?!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:44.880
No way, that stance is...

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.060
Morning Peacock!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.190
Sensei... Why...

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:05.950
Lee, I warned you to 
take this seriously.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.660
But it's just a test!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.870
Yeah, that was way too harsh!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.330
The format of the test 
is completely up to me.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.790
And Lee is a ninja who can 
only use martial arts.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.130
I'm grading him with different criteria.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.970
I'm told Naruto has already 
overtaken his master, Kakashi.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.430
You can have a one-week extension.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.470
If you can't win a match 
against me by then,

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.520
I'll have you demoted to genin!

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.490
Don't let it get you down.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.740
Maybe he's just in a bad mood.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.660
I've never seen Guy Sensei like that.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:03.500
Even when I went to his house and
ate the curry he'd been saving...

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.170
When did you do that?

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.090
Or when I farted in the elevator...

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.640
He had no escape?!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:13.600
Or when I stayed in the bathroom 
reading an entire Shonen Jump,

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.890
even though I knew he 
had to go really bad...

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:20.100
And entire issue? That's just cruel!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:25.190
Of course he got angry with me, 
but today was different.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:30.410
Yeah, for him to use the 
Morning Peacock against us...

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:35.770
Maybe hearing that Naruto had 
surpassed Kakashi Sensei...

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.550
...made him get fed up with me for

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:41.380
failing to improve after all this time.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.130
Don't act so depressed!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:47.460
You just need to beat 
him next week, right?

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.610
We'll help you train!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.640
Let me think about it.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.470
Lee...

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.480
I heard what happened.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:10.700
Guy really put you through the wringer.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.620
I want to prove that you 
can be a great ninja...

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.290
...without being able to
use ninjutsu or genjutsu.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.790
I've felt like that ever 
since the Academy.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.550
Effort, guts, passion...

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.460
I gave everything I had.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.550
Everything, everything, everything!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.220
Every bit, every bit,

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.390
every bit, every bit!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:42.650
All to become like my hero, Guy Sensei.

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:45.110
Whoa, wrong kind of hero.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.780
Let's forget about the Hanazono 
Rubgy Stadium for now.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:53.070
But it looks like Guy Sensei 
has finally given up on me.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:54.910
I wonder.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:00.330
That move is a double-edged
sword that hurts its user, too.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.960
If he resorted to using it...

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:05.920
You must understand 
why he was so strict.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:14.890
<i>I'm sorry. This is all I can do...</i>

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.810
<i>You fool!</i>

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:23.690
<i>I'm only being strict 
because I believe in you!</i>

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.150
No.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.940
He's trying to make me improve.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:31.150
But Guy Sensei's so strong...

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:36.240
I can't hope to beat my master
with just hand-to-hand combat...

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:39.410
There's no point to working hard
if you don't believe in yourself!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.710
That's what he always says, right?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.830
Kakashi Sensei...

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.130
Students surpassing their 
masters is one of the...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.760
...never ending cycles of life, 
and it's a good thing.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.880
Guy feels that you're 
ready to take that step.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:58.600
See ya.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:07.600
Lee?

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.570
Please help me!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:15.030
I must defeat Guy Sensei!

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:20.330
We start with basic forms. Fight!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.290
Leaf Whirlwind!

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:30.710
If you can't stand up to Neji's 
and my strongest attacks,

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.550
you'll never beat sensei!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:38.550
I understand.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.710
Your strikes have gotten 
much more precise.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.380
Thank you.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.590
But this isn't enough.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.890
The Morning Peacock problem, huh?

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.600
It destroys the opponent with 
flame and shock waves.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.850
Creating a move to counter it 
will be a Herculean effort.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:30.690
What if I come up with my 
own special shock wave, too?

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.400
Like that one legendary fighter!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.900
Of course!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.860
We'll get in a ton of 
trouble if you use that!

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.700
Oh, yeah...

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.330
Still, I need to think 
of a counterattack!

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.950
Morning Peacock...

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.040
Morning Peacock...

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.500
I wonder, why morning?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.080
Right!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.290
To completely understand my opponent,

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.840
I must exhaustively research 
the Morning Peacock!

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:58.010
Morning...

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.180
Hurry up, Nejimi!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.300
Why are you washing your 
hair in the morning?

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.890
I need to use the sink, too!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.060
Did we just start a skit?

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.140
And anyways this is a morning shampoo!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:12.480
I can't help it...

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.360
My hair will be a mess unless 
I wash, rinse, and repeat.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.990
You should get up early 
in the morning, too, Leeko.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.660
So it's stuff that you do
in the morning, huh?

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:26.120
Anyway, you two, come finish your
 morning coffee and morning breakfast!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.500
Don't bother! You're too ugly, Nejimi!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:34.590
I'm nothing compared to you, 
you super-hyper-ultra pig.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:35.500
Hey!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.510
Takes one to know one!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.130
Stop! Cut it out!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.930
Knock it off, the both of you!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.730
Ouch!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.020
That hair... It's just like a peacock!

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:56.270
Bingo, that's the secret 
behind the Morning Peacock!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.780
That makes no sense!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:00.280
And if I'm a peacock, you're a chicken!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.410
Well, we connected the 
morning to the peacock,

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.250
but it seemed kind of pointless.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.660
So what now?

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.500
If we don't figure out the 
Morning Peacock he can't win.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.590
There's only one option left.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:19.880
Take it head on and overcome!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.940
<b>I will Surpass Guy Sensei!</b>

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.150
One week later.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:44.110
Lee faces his beloved 
teacher in a showdown.

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.620
Today's the day.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.210
By the way, why are you all here?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.130
It sounded fun.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.000
To cheer for Lee!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.170
I felt responsible.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.760
I did egg him on a little.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.470
I wondered who'd win between...

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:09.060
...Turd-Brows and
Super Turd-Brows.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:11.250
Sai, please stop coming 
up with nicknames.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.480
Lee, this is a serious fight!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:23.740
I'm sure you're aware that if 
you don't win against me,

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.660
you'll be demoted to genin!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.140
I'm fully aware.

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:30.450
I will win...

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:33.120
...and surpass you, Guy Sensei!

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:38.680
T-This is kinda scary.

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.840
I've never seen them like this.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.300
What's gonna happen?

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:46.760
Ready... fight!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:51.230
Leaf Whirlwind!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:54.310
They both started with the same move!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.620
What a shock wave!

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.660
Who's kick landed?

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:07.530
Jeez, they both bashed 
their shins together!

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.740
This time I'll use a new move 
you don't know, Sensei!

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.550
Lee's got a new move?

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.450
When did he have the time?

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.580
The Leaf Whirlwind,
the Leaf Violent Wind...

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.460
<b>Leaf Whirlwind

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:22.440
I've learned many techniques from
you with "wind" in the name, Sensei.

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:27.010
This is the move I created 
from following that rule!

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:30.720
He's spinning fast!

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:35.350
Leaf Gentle Breeze!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.790
Oh, tee-hee...

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.560
Ew, that jutsu's gross!

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:45.420
The green reminds me of 
a kappa... and a big kappa?

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.780
Sai, are you still trying to
come up with nicknames?

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.260
That's just the beginning.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.260
The next one's even better!

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:58.760
That's some serious pressure!

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:01.380
Is he going to do something 
for real this time?

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:02.630
Here goes!

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:05.090
Leaf Naughty Wind!

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:10.970
For this move I rotate at high speed,

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:14.890
generating a naughty wind that blows
up the skirts of any nearby girls!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.660
That's just another dumb,
 perverted jutsu!

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:20.660
Sakura wears spandex shorts 
underneath her skirt,

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.040
but you still risked 
using that move anyway!

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.070
You're one heck of a guy, Bushy-Brows!

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.820
Don't be silly, Naruto.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:30.740
What man wouldn't want a glimpse
of those plump spandex―

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.490
What do you mean "plump?!"

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.180
Sakura, I understand how you feel,

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.120
but they're in the middle of their match!

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:42.140
Fine, on to the next move!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.170
<b>Leaf Snack</b>

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:44.210
Leaf Snack, Octopuffs!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.210
<b>Octopuffs</b>

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.490
That wasn't wind. It wasn't even a jutsu!

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:58.490
The soy sauce base is combined
flawlessly with the octopus flavoring!

00:15:58.490 --> 00:15:59.530
Neji?!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:01.450
No, there's more...

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:02.620
The perfect level of crispiness...

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.060
Even my Sharingan can't 
fully comprehend it!

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:07.710
Why is everyone analyzing this 
stupid snack so seriously?

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:10.420
And you all eat way too fast!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:11.460
Well played, Lee.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:13.380
I love these for a snack, too!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:14.510
Not you, too, Guy Sensei!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.470
And are you taking damage?

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:19.750
The time for goofing around 
is about to end...

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.180
Here comes Guy!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.420
Hey, he ate the whole bag!

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:28.150
Lee...

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.130
Have you exhausted all your new moves?

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:35.490
Now it's my turn to take the offensive.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:39.410
I warned you I'd be attacking seriously.
 Prepare yourself!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.810
He's opening the eight gates.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.770
Then Guy Sensei's about to use it...

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:49.980
I've seen the Morning 
Peacock countless times.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:52.240
That's why I'm going to―

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:56.450
Lee!

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.680
I'm sorry, guys...

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.930
You did so much to help me...

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:08.060
So good. The barbecue 
flavor's just as tasty—

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.310
Can't you wait till later to eat those?

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:12.650
You trained with me all that time...

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.950
Lee, forgive me.

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.150
Lee!

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.840
Thank you both so much.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:40.370
It's because of you that 
I found my answer.

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:44.330
Guy Sensei, you're incredibly powerful.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:48.540
But I won't let our fight end yet!

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.860
They've both opened the eight gates.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.680
What's he thinking?

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.350
Come on, Lee!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:06.350
<i>Our training gave me a hint.</i>

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.410
<i>The Morning Peacock is a high-speed,</i>

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.060
<i>wide-range, multiple-strike attack.</i>

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:13.880
<i>The only way to counter 
it is to be even faster!</i>

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:16.320
<i>Faster... Much faster...</i>

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.050
<i>My jutsu that's even faster 
than a Morning Peacock!</i>

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.540
Morning Chicken!

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:25.540
Huh?! Why a chicken?!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.420
Morning Peacock!

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:34.710
This is getting crazy!

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:36.980
I see. He thought this through.

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.360
The chicken wakes up
before the peacock.

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:45.000
That's how it can beat the peacock!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.730
That has nothing to do with this!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.570
You think you're faster 
than my Morning Peacock?

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.000
Gotcha!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:02.990
Wow!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.950
What... was that?

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.600
I'm just... getting started...

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:15.600
I will... surpass... Sensei...

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:19.570
Lee!

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.850
I'm so pathetic.

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:32.620
Sensei unleashed the Morning Peacock 
because he believed in me,

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.290
but I couldn't do it.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.210
I guess I'll lose my rank as a chunin.

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.550
Oh, no...

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.590
Then he's going to call me a fool.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:44.490
Indeed,

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.510
you are a huge fool.

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:51.210
No matter how many times I punch you,

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.040
you keep getting up,
 training like a man possessed,

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:58.130
and now you're starting to overtake me.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:02.430
On that last exchange, 
your attack was faster.

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:08.820
Seeing that proved to me
that you will become...

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:11.660
...a splendid ninja who will 
definitely surpass me.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:13.910
A splendid fool of a ninja!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.150
Then, I...

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.670
You just barely pass!

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.710
Thank you very much!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:23.380
But be ready.

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:27.890
I'm going to work you to the bone
until you surpass me for real!

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:30.180
<i>Lee...</i>

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:33.180
<i>I'm so proud of you!</i>

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:37.310
Guy Sensei...

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:40.440
Guy Sensei!

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.400
Lee!

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.070
They're expressing their 
love in a weird new way...

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:50.030
It's like two roosters crowing!

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:53.940
Look, it's finally over. 
That's good enough, right?

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:55.290
Okay!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:57.080
How about chicken-kappas?

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.900
You're still working on that?!

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:05.170
It looks like Lee has a ways to 
go before overtaking his master.

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:09.680
But maybe the day isn't so far off!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:17.600
Okay, let's train you to improve on
that nice new move you developed!

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:18.840
Yes, Guy Sensei!

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.480
Morning Fried Chicken!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.390
<b>growl</b>

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:28.530
This jutsu makes me hungry.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:31.950
Can we get away from the 
morning stuff, please?

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:33.270
<b>growl</b>

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:34.120
Tenten, give me some of that!

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:35.480
<b>growl</b>

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:34.740
No way.

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:35.410
Come on!

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:36.450
No!

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:39.420
What's wrong with you two? 
You want to get in on this?

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:44.950
Cock-a-doodle-do!

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:25.140
Next week's title is
 "I Want my Popularity Back!"

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:26.740
<b>I Want My Popularity Back!
Death!</b>

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:26.760
And "Death!"

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:27.620
That second title's creepy!

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:29.170
There's no way it'll be serious!

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:32.660
It's the story of a script writer
 who collapsed with a sudden illness,

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:34.620
but as the deadline approached, 
despite spewing bloody vomit,

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:36.930
he mustered the strength to pick up his pen

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.240
and then snuck out of the hospital
 while he was still admitted

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:40.800
and made it to the meeting.

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:43.580
His burning passion and willingness to die 
 are contained within this title.

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:45.550
That was quite a back story.

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:47.820
Script writers have it rough.
